            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="about-text">
                   
  <p><strong>QUIZZICLES</strong> is an <strong>annual free online mathematics and physics competition</strong>, open to everyone who loves a good challenge — from curious school students to passionate undergrads and lifelong learners.</p>

  <div class="section">
    <h2><span class="emoji">🎯</span>What’s it all about?</h2>
    <p>Inspired by legendary contests like <em>Physics Brawl</em> and <em>OPhO</em>, QUIZZICLES was created in 2024 by a bunch of students who just wanted to solve some awesome problems — but couldn’t find the right competition at that time of the year. So they made their own. Now it’s your turn to join in the fun.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2><span class="emoji">🧠</span>Who can participate?</h2>
    <p>There are two categories:</p>
    <ul>
      <strong>Student:</strong> For students from classes 8–12 and 1st year undergrads <br>
      <strong>Open:</strong> For everyone else. Yes, that includes you.
    </ul>
    <p>But don’t worry — everyone gets the same set of questions, so you’re competing on pure brainpower.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2><span class="emoji">🚀</span>Why should you care?</h2>
    <p>Because QUIZZICLES isn’t just a competition — it’s a celebration of ideas, logic, and that “aha!” moment when a tricky question clicks. Whether you’re aiming for the top spot or just in it for the thrill of problem-solving, we promise it’ll be worth your time.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2><span class="emoji">✨</span>Our motto?</h2>
    <blockquote>Fall in love with the questions.</blockquote>
  </div>
                    
